 prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, September to October ran 161% of normal on the middle, then November to December fell to 61% of normal. Grid 21477 had its driest year in 1963, at 66% of normal.</p>"}
